== B. GFF_Reader coordinate conversion
  GTF one       -> chr1:[0,1)/+  length 1
  GTF hundred   -> chr1:[100,200)/-  length 100
  GTF nostrand  -> chr1:[4,8)/.  length 4
  end_included=False one       -> chr1:[0,0)/+
  end_included=False hundred   -> chr1:[100,199)/-
  end_included=False nostrand  -> chr1:[4,7)/.
  GFF3 {'ID': 'e1', 'Parent': 'g1'} -> chr1:[100,200)/+
  stranded=True with a '.' feature: ValueError as documented -> Feature nostrand at chr1:[4,8)/. does not have strand information but  ...
  stranded=False: features ['hundred', 'nostrand', 'one'] base 0 -> {'one'} base 4..7 -> [set(), {'nostrand'}, {'nostrand'}, set()]

